WEBVTT

00:20.840 --> 00:23.120
BEAUTY

00:23.920 --> 00:25.640
Good morning, everyone.

00:25.720 --> 00:28.080
We want to welcome you all

00:28.160 --> 00:31.560
to this year's Shining Star
award ceremonies.

00:31.640 --> 00:34.440
As always, the winner will receive
a special prize.

00:34.520 --> 00:39.440
Are you beautiful enough
to be our shining star?

00:39.520 --> 00:41.960
So, tune in to find out

00:42.040 --> 00:46.600
if you have what it takes
to be one of our top ten.

00:46.680 --> 00:48.160
[computer-generated voice]
That's right.

00:48.240 --> 00:53.160
Beauty means everything to a girl.

00:53.240 --> 00:56.880
There's no such thing as ugly.

00:57.600 --> 00:59.400
Only laziness.

00:59.480 --> 01:01.400
So, don't be that girl.

01:06.440 --> 01:07.640
[wind rustling]

01:18.520 --> 01:21.520
[theme music]

02:32.480 --> 02:34.640
[computer-generated voice]
Good morning, everyone.

02:34.720 --> 02:37.880
The ranking is different today.

02:37.960 --> 02:39.160
But don't worry, girl,

02:39.240 --> 02:43.000
you can always be prettier tomorrow.

02:45.760 --> 02:48.560
GODDESS OF BEAUTY

02:50.080 --> 02:51.320
[Nanno] Excuse me. Hello.

02:52.160 --> 02:54.560
[teacher] Hi. Welcome to class.
Come on in.

02:57.320 --> 02:59.320
Would you like
to introduce yourself to them?

03:00.320 --> 03:01.240
Hi, everyone.

03:01.880 --> 03:03.160
My name is Nanno.

03:04.320 --> 03:05.560
I'm new here.

03:06.920 --> 03:08.160
Princess Ten.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.320
Yes, ma'am?

03:10.400 --> 03:13.440
Nanno is joining us
in the middle of the semester.

03:13.520 --> 03:14.760
[teacher] Please show her
around the school

03:14.840 --> 03:17.280
-and help her get adjusted to everything.
-I would love to.

03:17.360 --> 03:19.680
Nanno, you can sit next to Ying there.

03:19.760 --> 03:20.600
Thanks.

03:22.160 --> 03:23.200
[giggles]

03:23.280 --> 03:27.480
[Nanno] When two girls smile,
it means one of two things.

03:28.520 --> 03:29.400
[swooshes]

03:29.480 --> 03:30.800
They will be friends…

03:30.880 --> 03:31.720
[swooshes]

03:31.800 --> 03:34.040
…or they will be enemies.

03:35.440 --> 03:38.320
[teacher] Everyone, take your books out
and let's get started.

03:38.400 --> 03:41.720
[Nanno] They'll be enemies
if one is prettier.

03:43.000 --> 03:45.280
[teacher] Today, we will talk about…

03:45.360 --> 03:46.360
Uh,

03:46.840 --> 03:48.680
what happened to your face?

03:49.960 --> 03:52.760
Oh, I cut it somehow. I don't know.

03:52.840 --> 03:54.440
No, it looks like it really hurt.

03:54.960 --> 03:57.800
You know, you really need
to take care of yourself.

03:58.560 --> 04:00.920
You don't wanna go around blemished here.

04:01.000 --> 04:03.080
[Nanno] She's pretending to care about me.

04:03.160 --> 04:04.880
This is getting interesting.

04:04.960 --> 04:05.920
-Yeah.
-[both giggle]

04:06.000 --> 04:06.840
[teacher] Mm-hmm.

04:08.240 --> 04:09.600
[both chuckle lightly]

04:11.200 --> 04:16.120
[bell clangs]

04:16.200 --> 04:17.720
LERD FAH TOWER

04:18.800 --> 04:20.720
"Top Ten Only"?

04:21.959 --> 04:24.200
This building is for the "Top Ten".

04:25.880 --> 04:27.120
Top ten?

04:29.680 --> 04:33.800
Hold on.
Have you really not heard of us at all?

04:35.600 --> 04:37.200
[Ying giggles]

04:37.280 --> 04:41.360
We rank the top ten
most beautiful girls in the school.

04:43.200 --> 04:45.920
[Ying] We have an app that updates
the ranking in real time.

04:46.960 --> 04:50.200
So, you could always check your phone
to see what number you are.

04:52.040 --> 04:54.720
It's a privilege to live in this building.

04:54.800 --> 04:57.000
We must make sure our top ten are happy,

04:57.080 --> 04:59.880
because they will spread
our school's beauty to the world.

05:01.720 --> 05:03.480
Where are you in the ranking?

05:05.200 --> 05:06.160
[relieved sigh]

05:07.040 --> 05:08.440
I'm lucky.

05:08.520 --> 05:10.040
I am number ten,

05:11.280 --> 05:13.920
even though I'm not the prettiest girl.

05:16.080 --> 05:17.480
No wonder.

05:17.560 --> 05:19.200
That's why you're Princess Ten.

05:21.240 --> 05:22.600
Nanno, wanna come see inside?

05:24.400 --> 05:25.800
[Nanno] Hmm.

05:26.400 --> 05:32.440
Didn't you say this building is only
for the girls there in the top ten?

05:34.760 --> 05:38.720
Yeah, but the top ten

05:38.800 --> 05:41.160
can bring someone
as their very own personal guest.

05:42.120 --> 05:47.760
[Ying] Do you wanna see what it's like
to live as one of the top ten girls?

05:48.800 --> 05:49.960
I'd love to.

05:51.200 --> 05:52.960
Like it? Nice, huh?

05:54.600 --> 05:56.120
[Ying] The dining room.

05:56.600 --> 05:58.920
And that's the living room.

05:59.840 --> 06:01.920
[director] Hello there, everyone.

06:02.520 --> 06:05.240
I'm sending my support to you all.

06:05.320 --> 06:09.480
I hope you become the next Shining Star.

06:09.560 --> 06:13.640
There are so many prizes you can receive,
but only if you can prove you're worthy.

06:14.280 --> 06:18.720
Don't forget that beauty
is your most valuable commodity.

06:18.800 --> 06:21.600
As a woman, you must let your beauty
be your guide.

06:21.680 --> 06:23.800
That way, you'll be on the top ten.

06:23.880 --> 06:28.200
Let's thank our beauty
for getting us here.

06:28.280 --> 06:29.960
Good luck to you all.

06:30.520 --> 06:34.560
Work hard on the outside,
to show people you care.

06:35.040 --> 06:37.360
I have faith in every one of you.

06:37.440 --> 06:39.400
You're all so beautiful.

06:40.080 --> 06:42.640
And remember, you can all be top ten.

06:42.720 --> 06:44.920
So, don't waste your youth, ladies.

06:45.760 --> 06:47.640
Now, go and shine.

06:51.240 --> 06:52.760
[Ying] Come on. Let's go eat.

06:53.640 --> 06:54.520
It's this way.

07:01.680 --> 07:02.800
It's good, right?

07:03.840 --> 07:06.760
[Nanno] It is. Thank you so much, Ying.

07:07.760 --> 07:09.040
Oh, don't worry.

07:09.120 --> 07:12.040
It's not like I paid for your meal
or anything like that.

07:12.800 --> 07:14.800
[Nanno] Yeah, but you brought me in here.

07:16.480 --> 07:17.960
It's totally my pleasure.

07:19.680 --> 07:21.040
Although…

07:23.760 --> 07:26.200
you should know that you can't come
with me all the time.

07:26.280 --> 07:28.200
100% HONEST

07:29.560 --> 07:30.720
Most days,

07:30.800 --> 07:34.040
you are going to have to eat out there
together with the ordinary people,

07:34.120 --> 07:36.080
with the normal folks, you know.

07:37.640 --> 07:38.720
80% HONEST

07:39.800 --> 07:42.800
But it's really not that bad out there.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.200
70% HONEST

07:45.960 --> 07:49.720
Sometimes, I think I would like
to live outside in the real world.

07:51.200 --> 07:52.120
50% HONEST

07:54.920 --> 07:56.720
You are really down to earth.

08:19.520 --> 08:20.520
[Ying] Nanno.

08:21.080 --> 08:23.560
Chocolate contains trans-fat.

08:31.520 --> 08:32.640
Uhm…

08:38.360 --> 08:39.840
I'll have one small bite.

08:41.159 --> 08:42.720
I don't wanna be rude.

08:56.200 --> 09:00.680
[girl stammering]

09:00.760 --> 09:02.480
Good afternoon, Princess.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.560
Hello there, Chompoo.

09:05.360 --> 09:06.960
How did you get in here?

09:07.480 --> 09:08.600
I…

09:09.960 --> 09:10.920
[stammering]

09:13.040 --> 09:14.520
Chompoo,

09:14.600 --> 09:16.400
you know you can't just come in here.

09:17.240 --> 09:19.160
Now without one of the top ten.

09:26.040 --> 09:27.160
Want some cake?

09:29.320 --> 09:31.160
Here. Take it.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.760
[Ying] I can't eat it all.

09:33.240 --> 09:34.440
Too much fat.

09:36.920 --> 09:37.960
Really?

09:38.040 --> 09:40.960
[stuttering]

09:41.040 --> 09:42.600
Thank you.

09:42.680 --> 09:44.200
Excuse me. You can't be here.

09:45.360 --> 09:48.720
[muffled]
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

09:48.800 --> 09:49.920
Bye, Ying!

09:50.000 --> 09:51.640
[groaning]

09:52.480 --> 09:54.280
I feel so bad for Chompoo.

09:55.640 --> 09:57.880
With that flat face and nose of hers,

09:57.960 --> 09:59.920
she'll never get to live here with us.

10:01.720 --> 10:02.720
50% HONEST

10:02.800 --> 10:04.600
I feel bad for her,

10:05.120 --> 10:06.960
so I bring her in here

10:07.600 --> 10:08.680
to give her some

10:09.200 --> 10:10.520
of her special food.

10:10.600 --> 10:11.440
10% HONEST

10:14.160 --> 10:17.400
You're pretty and so thoughtful.

10:18.040 --> 10:20.040
You should be the Shining Star.

10:22.280 --> 10:23.400
No, no.

10:24.000 --> 10:27.440
I just wanna help.
I don't need to be number one.

10:27.520 --> 10:30.120
0% HONEST

10:30.200 --> 10:32.360
[bell clangs]

10:33.520 --> 10:34.680
I think she's here.

10:35.440 --> 10:36.360
Who is?

10:36.840 --> 10:38.000
It's the queen.

10:38.880 --> 10:40.200
Queen?

10:40.680 --> 10:44.280
Come on. I'll show you
who the real Shining Star is.

10:46.800 --> 10:48.640
[majestic music playing]

10:52.680 --> 10:53.960
[Ying] That's Gade.

10:54.040 --> 10:55.640
She's in first place.

10:55.720 --> 10:58.680
NUMBER 1, GADE PIMNAPA

10:59.240 --> 11:00.520
Those are the twins,

11:00.600 --> 11:02.160
they are Cherry and Lilly.

11:02.240 --> 11:04.720
They are in second and third place.

11:05.280 --> 11:07.920
And those girls are named Kim and Fah.

11:08.000 --> 11:10.040
They are fifth and seventh.

11:12.520 --> 11:16.920
Gade is smart, friendly, and beautiful.

11:17.000 --> 11:18.600
Wow, look.

11:18.680 --> 11:22.040
She walks just like a swan.

11:22.720 --> 11:25.400
But Ying, wouldn't you like to be
number one?

11:28.760 --> 11:32.480
I think you're as beautiful as Gade.

11:32.560 --> 11:35.120
[majestic music continues playing]

11:41.720 --> 11:43.080
[Ying] You're insane.

11:44.240 --> 11:45.480
For me,

11:46.120 --> 11:48.080
being in the top ten is a great honor.

11:48.160 --> 11:50.280
I don't know
if I could be the Shining Star.

11:51.080 --> 11:52.920
I've not thought about it.

11:53.720 --> 11:55.480
No one can be Gade.

11:56.800 --> 12:02.120
Like I told you before.
I don't really wanna be the Shining Star.

12:04.120 --> 12:06.240
[Nanno] Ying? Ying.

12:09.080 --> 12:10.560
You don't know about that.

12:14.360 --> 12:15.360
Nanno.

12:15.920 --> 12:18.720
Actually, you're quite pretty too.

12:19.920 --> 12:22.360
Why don't you go look at your ranking
on your app, you wanna?

12:22.440 --> 12:25.080
Hmm, I don't think so.

12:25.160 --> 12:28.160
I would be happy even if I was last.

12:28.240 --> 12:30.520
Hmm. Let's just take a look.

12:30.600 --> 12:31.440
Come on.

12:31.520 --> 12:32.760
I'll check for you.

12:34.800 --> 12:35.800
[keypad clicks]

12:37.560 --> 12:38.760
[beeping]

12:40.880 --> 12:41.720
[beeps]

12:41.800 --> 12:43.320
MARA AMARATAYAKUL

12:43.400 --> 12:44.760
What?

12:44.840 --> 12:46.360
I can't believe it.

12:46.880 --> 12:48.320
I'm in 11th?

12:48.840 --> 12:50.840
Only one place behind you,

12:51.760 --> 12:53.680
even though you're prettier.

12:58.680 --> 13:00.200
You deserve it, Nanno.

13:01.320 --> 13:02.160
Yeah.

13:06.520 --> 13:08.800
Uhm… So, I have to go.

13:08.880 --> 13:10.280
Thank you, Ying.

13:29.760 --> 13:30.600
[cell phone beeps]

13:34.480 --> 13:36.360
[computer-generated voice]
We are sorry to inform you

13:36.440 --> 13:40.400
that you have been moved
to the 11th position.

13:40.480 --> 13:41.560
[groans]

13:42.920 --> 13:44.080
[gasps]

13:47.360 --> 13:48.240
[groans]

13:56.720 --> 13:58.080
[groaning]

14:10.440 --> 14:12.600
[student 1] Congratulations, Nanno.

14:13.360 --> 14:15.360
[student 2] You're new,
but you're already in ten.

14:16.960 --> 14:19.720
[student 3] You might move up faster
than Ying did.

14:19.800 --> 14:23.280
[student 1] Ying has been in tenth place
for the longest time.

14:23.360 --> 14:26.800
[girls giggling]

14:29.600 --> 14:31.600
[student 2] Come on, you know it's true.

14:31.680 --> 14:32.560
It's her.

14:41.080 --> 14:43.760
Nice day, isn't it… Princess Ten.

14:47.920 --> 14:49.240
Not anymore.

14:49.800 --> 14:50.880
You're in tenth place now.

14:51.600 --> 14:56.800
[student 2]
Aw, come on. You're still Princess 11.

14:58.200 --> 15:00.240
It's only temporary.

15:00.320 --> 15:04.040
Once your pimple goes away,
you'll be in the top ten again.

15:05.840 --> 15:09.080
[student 1]
Why would you let yourself get a pimple?

15:09.160 --> 15:11.360
I haven't seen you with one before.

15:14.960 --> 15:18.240
[student 3] No. Stop.
It will get worse if you keep touching it.

15:18.320 --> 15:22.120
You must have been eating chocolates.
They can give you lots of pimples.

15:31.160 --> 15:33.000
You can't leave it like that.

15:33.080 --> 15:36.200
I know of a good clinic. Should we go?

15:38.120 --> 15:41.280
Yeah, why don't you have
a look at your face?

15:41.920 --> 15:43.400
[student 1] Yeah, this is great.

15:46.120 --> 15:48.960
Let's go, Ying. I'm free this evening.

15:50.880 --> 15:52.080
I'll be okay.

15:52.560 --> 15:53.680
Thank you, though.

15:56.320 --> 15:59.560
Uhm, I guess, I will go then.

16:00.760 --> 16:01.720
Come on, let's go.

16:06.240 --> 16:07.120
Bye.

16:08.560 --> 16:09.440
Hmm.

16:11.240 --> 16:14.040
This bow is so tight, isn't it?

16:24.560 --> 16:26.520
[director] Every student should believe

16:26.600 --> 16:28.320
-[bell clangs]
-in their beauty.

16:29.840 --> 16:31.240
Good luck out there.

16:33.800 --> 16:37.040
[staff] Your name is not in the top ten.
Who did you come in with?

16:37.520 --> 16:39.160
[Nanno] She came here as my guest.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.720
Ying, come sit with me.

16:47.480 --> 16:48.640
[Ying] No, that's okay.

16:49.360 --> 16:51.880
I ended up here by accident.

16:53.000 --> 16:56.960
I sort of missed the food
in the other canteen.

16:58.520 --> 17:00.080
I'll just go there and get something.

17:00.840 --> 17:03.800
You can come and sit
with me tomorrow, if you want.

17:04.839 --> 17:08.839
So, then we can hang out
and have a good time together.

17:09.640 --> 17:12.680
It's so lonely just sitting here.

17:13.760 --> 17:14.760
[relieved sigh]

17:15.640 --> 17:16.599
Sure.

17:20.400 --> 17:22.119
[girls giggling]

17:27.960 --> 17:29.880
[computer-generated voice]
Ordinary people.

17:29.960 --> 17:32.200
[suspenseful music playing]

17:41.880 --> 17:44.640
[groans, spits]

17:44.720 --> 17:46.280
[giggling]

17:49.800 --> 17:51.080
[gasps]

17:54.440 --> 17:57.240
[shrieks]

18:02.480 --> 18:04.240
[shrilling]

18:11.760 --> 18:13.160
SPECIAL PRICE
FROM 30,000 TO 19,000

18:16.800 --> 18:17.720
[cell phone beeps]

18:19.840 --> 18:21.120
[Wi] Ying.

18:21.800 --> 18:23.600
I want to show you this.

18:24.120 --> 18:25.400
Look at this right here, Ying.

18:25.960 --> 18:28.120
I'm in the top ten now.

18:28.200 --> 18:29.440
I'm in sixth place.

18:29.520 --> 18:31.840
[breathing heavily]

18:32.720 --> 18:33.720
[gasps]

18:35.440 --> 18:37.240
[groaning]

18:41.920 --> 18:43.240
[laughing]

18:43.320 --> 18:44.680
NUMBER 6, WI PISCHA

18:50.480 --> 18:54.480
And this year's
Shining Star award goes to…

18:55.040 --> 18:59.160
a beautiful girl by the name of Ying!

18:59.240 --> 19:02.040
[clapping]

19:07.520 --> 19:08.440
[metal clanging]

19:08.520 --> 19:13.080
[director screaming]

19:13.160 --> 19:17.000
[gasping]

19:17.080 --> 19:19.560
[screaming]

19:22.440 --> 19:24.480
[breathing heavily]

19:24.560 --> 19:25.480
[cell phone beeps]

19:26.640 --> 19:28.960
[computer-generated voice]
We are sorry to inform you

19:29.040 --> 19:32.440
that you have dropped to 21st position.

19:33.800 --> 19:35.240
NUMBER 21, YING CHENCHONNANEE

19:35.320 --> 19:36.280
Huh?

19:40.840 --> 19:43.320
[groaning]

19:44.400 --> 19:48.080
LERD FAH TOWER

20:20.760 --> 20:22.080
[Nanno] How's it going, Ying.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.160
Nanno.

20:24.960 --> 20:26.200
What do you have there?

20:26.960 --> 20:28.160
Is that for your pimples?

20:30.440 --> 20:31.400
No.

20:33.800 --> 20:37.600
[Nanno]
Hmm, this store has so many good brands.

20:38.120 --> 20:40.960
Let's buy some things,
so our rankings improve.

20:43.280 --> 20:45.000
Which one of these should I get?

20:48.160 --> 20:51.640
[breathing heavily]

20:51.720 --> 20:52.560
[gasps]

20:53.160 --> 20:54.760
Oh, Ying.

20:54.840 --> 20:55.680
[Chompoo] Ying!

21:06.040 --> 21:07.280
Ah.

21:13.840 --> 21:17.000
TWO DAYS LATER…

21:17.080 --> 21:19.120
[alarm beeping]

21:23.160 --> 21:24.680
NUMBER 21, YING CHENCHONNANEE

21:24.760 --> 21:26.000
[gasps]

21:26.080 --> 21:27.120
My pimple's gone.

21:27.200 --> 21:28.880
[computer-generated voice]
Congratulations.

21:28.960 --> 21:31.760
-You have climbed the rankings
-[giggles]

21:31.840 --> 21:33.400
to tenth place.

21:34.680 --> 21:35.960
[student 1] What class do you have?

21:36.040 --> 21:37.800
-[student 2] I can't remember.
-Hey!

21:38.640 --> 21:41.080
Jom, Best, hello.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.600
[Jom and Best] We're okay. Thanks.

21:42.680 --> 21:43.880
I'll see you in class, okay?

21:46.200 --> 21:47.400
What's with her?

21:47.480 --> 21:49.440
-She's acting weird, isn't she?
-[Ying giggles]

21:58.160 --> 21:59.800
Why are you touching that thing?

22:00.960 --> 22:01.960
New.

22:02.840 --> 22:05.480
Just enjoying myself
by going on the swing.

22:06.320 --> 22:07.400
Wanna join me?

22:10.280 --> 22:12.480
You haven't heard then, have you?

22:12.560 --> 22:14.400
Why don't you check your messages?

22:15.160 --> 22:17.520
[New] I should be inviting you.

22:17.600 --> 22:21.320
Anyway, it was nice to see you.
You should go now.

22:25.520 --> 22:26.560
Stop!

22:26.640 --> 22:27.480
Stop!

22:27.560 --> 22:28.680
[gasps]

22:28.760 --> 22:30.240
[cell phone beeps]

22:32.440 --> 22:34.960
[computer-generated voice]
We are sorry to inform you.

22:35.040 --> 22:39.080
You have dropped down to 11th position.

22:40.200 --> 22:42.200
NUMBER 11, YING CHENCHONNANEE

22:43.320 --> 22:45.600
LERD FAH TOWER

22:54.320 --> 22:56.560
[staff] You are no longer welcome
in this space.

22:57.520 --> 22:59.440
[Nanno]
Don't worry about it. She's with me.

23:05.160 --> 23:07.480
Come join me, Princess 11.

23:11.560 --> 23:12.760
No, that's okay.

23:15.040 --> 23:16.560
How about I push you?

23:17.520 --> 23:18.440
Mm.

23:19.680 --> 23:22.320
Ying, you are so nice.

23:28.520 --> 23:30.360
Thank you, Ying.

23:30.440 --> 23:32.160
It really is a shame.

23:32.240 --> 23:36.240
I wish that we were in the top ten
together finally.

23:38.600 --> 23:40.040
What can I do?

23:40.120 --> 23:41.680
This is all I can do for now.

23:43.000 --> 23:44.640
Don't give up just yet, Ying.

23:45.880 --> 23:47.800
There might be a way to get back in.

23:48.840 --> 23:50.760
If you're not this pretty,

23:52.200 --> 23:54.400
there may be a way to make
the other girls ugly.

24:04.600 --> 24:05.760
[Nanno] Wait.

24:07.320 --> 24:08.160
Ying.

24:10.760 --> 24:12.200
You're pushing too hard, Ying.

24:19.120 --> 24:20.120
Ying!

24:25.000 --> 24:26.000
Nanno!

24:27.960 --> 24:29.000
Nanno.

24:31.240 --> 24:32.240
[cell phone beeps]

24:34.240 --> 24:35.560
[computer-generated voice]
Congratulations.

24:35.640 --> 24:39.600
You have made it back to the top ten.

24:39.680 --> 24:41.040
[giggles]

24:46.760 --> 24:49.440
[giggles]
Thank you, Nanno.

25:09.520 --> 25:11.040
[girls laughing]

25:11.120 --> 25:13.520
Let's eat after we do our makeup.

25:13.600 --> 25:15.480
-I'm so hungry.
-[giggling]

25:15.560 --> 25:16.440
That's right.

25:16.520 --> 25:18.560
Have you heard what happened?

25:18.640 --> 25:20.120
Put on some blush.

25:20.680 --> 25:22.440
Hey, listen.

25:22.520 --> 25:25.040
Have you heard what happened? Okay.

25:25.120 --> 25:27.120
-About what?
-It's Ying.

25:27.200 --> 25:28.960
She's back in the top ten again, you know.

25:29.040 --> 25:31.600
[Lilly] Oh, yeah. I heard.
We all heard. It's true.

25:31.680 --> 25:34.480
Nanno fell off the swing.

25:34.560 --> 25:37.320
It's true. She fell off the swing.

25:38.000 --> 25:40.440
[Fah] Every year,
as the award day approaches,

25:40.520 --> 25:42.560
things like this happen.

25:43.040 --> 25:45.400
Yeah, remember that shitty thing
that happened to Ann?

25:45.480 --> 25:46.800
-Ann?
-Uh-huh.

25:46.880 --> 25:49.040
The day right before the ceremony,

25:49.120 --> 25:52.080
she dropped from 2nd to 40th place.

25:52.560 --> 25:54.680
Yeah, that did happen.

25:55.840 --> 25:57.520
28 places.

25:58.120 --> 26:00.400
-38. Your math sucks.
-[Fah laughing]

26:00.480 --> 26:02.760
Whatever, you know what I mean, though.

26:02.840 --> 26:04.400
-[laughing]
-[Fah] That's a lot.

26:05.600 --> 26:08.480
[Kim] Actually, Gade, I do pity Ying.

26:08.560 --> 26:10.680
She's been in tenth place forever.

26:12.200 --> 26:14.200
I feel bad for her.

26:14.280 --> 26:16.360
You can't blame her for it, though.

26:16.440 --> 26:17.880
In Ying's case,

26:17.960 --> 26:19.640
blame it on her mother.

26:20.520 --> 26:21.920
[girls] Ooh!

26:22.640 --> 26:24.000
Damn.

26:24.080 --> 26:27.480
[laughing]

26:28.120 --> 26:29.280
I'm hungry now.

26:29.360 --> 26:32.200
-Come on. Let's eat.
-Our appointed afternoon tea.

26:32.280 --> 26:34.600
-[Cherry] I want macaroons.
-[Lilly] I want carrot cake.

26:34.680 --> 26:35.800
[Kim] Carrot cake again?

26:35.880 --> 26:37.320
[Fah] I want some orange juice.

26:37.400 --> 26:38.720
[Kim] That sounds good.

26:48.120 --> 26:49.760
In Ying's case,

26:49.840 --> 26:51.400
blame it on her mother.

26:51.480 --> 26:53.200
Blame it on her mother.

26:55.360 --> 26:56.800
[Ying, in thought]
My mother?

27:05.880 --> 27:08.280
[classical piano music playing]

27:34.360 --> 27:35.600
[Wi screaming]

27:35.680 --> 27:36.760
NUMBER 9, YING CHENCHONNANEE

27:39.040 --> 27:43.000
-[Fah] Ah, why is it so itchy?
-[Kim] Right? What is this?

27:43.080 --> 27:45.840
[both scream]

27:46.920 --> 27:48.520
NUMBER 7, YING CHENCHONNANEE

27:55.400 --> 27:57.160
[giggles]

27:57.840 --> 27:59.880
[Ying] You deserve this, you bitch.

28:01.320 --> 28:02.720
[giggles]

28:02.800 --> 28:04.960
Does something smell strange to you?

28:07.600 --> 28:09.600
Oh, my god, look. What's that?

28:09.680 --> 28:10.720
[Pim] Help! Help!

28:11.320 --> 28:12.600
NUMBER 4, YING CHENCHONNANEE

28:23.040 --> 28:25.160
-Ew, look at you.
-What?

28:25.240 --> 28:27.160
You're a monkey.
[laughs]

28:27.240 --> 28:28.440
[shrieks]

28:28.520 --> 28:29.400
NUMBER 2, YING CHENCHONNANEE

28:29.480 --> 28:32.040
Stop it, Cherry. Go to the nurse.

28:32.120 --> 28:33.920
Hello, it's me, Gade.

28:34.000 --> 28:36.880
Today, I will review a new cream.

28:36.960 --> 28:39.640
It really works.

28:40.240 --> 28:41.440
[Nanno] What are you doing?

28:42.320 --> 28:44.600
Oh, Nanno. You frightened me.

28:44.680 --> 28:48.480
You've been busy these days, haven't you?

28:49.160 --> 28:52.080
Since it's so close to naming
the Shining Star,

28:52.160 --> 28:53.840
I think you should be careful.

28:55.480 --> 28:56.480
Of course, yeah.

29:01.040 --> 29:03.280
[Gade screaming]

29:16.160 --> 29:21.120
[static]

29:45.520 --> 29:48.160
LERD FAH TOWER

30:00.040 --> 30:01.120
Hey, there.

30:04.400 --> 30:05.760
[Ying] What are you doing here?

30:06.800 --> 30:07.640
Right now,

30:07.720 --> 30:09.960
our school's beauty standard has dropped.

30:10.040 --> 30:11.680
Even with this face,

30:12.360 --> 30:14.240
I'm still in third place.

30:14.760 --> 30:16.200
I wonder why that is.

30:20.320 --> 30:21.880
I don't know. What happened?

30:22.560 --> 30:25.560
[Nanno] Ying. You don't have to play dumb.

30:26.200 --> 30:27.200
You

30:27.840 --> 30:29.480
are a role model

30:29.560 --> 30:31.920
for all those wannabes out there.

30:32.880 --> 30:34.800
They're all trying to copy you.

30:42.480 --> 30:44.680
Are you here to steal
my crown, then, Nanno?

30:44.760 --> 30:46.320
[Nanno chuckles]

30:47.360 --> 30:49.400
Being the Shining Star
is not important to me.

30:49.920 --> 30:52.080
But it sure is to someone like you.

30:53.960 --> 30:55.560
Isn't that right, Ying?

30:57.440 --> 30:59.240
Come on, you know it's true.

31:02.200 --> 31:03.360
Okay.

31:04.960 --> 31:07.400
Are you sure you've already won?

31:11.560 --> 31:12.600
[Ying] What do you want?

31:13.440 --> 31:14.720
For you to leave.

31:15.320 --> 31:18.560
[Nanno] Mm. Ying. Don't forget.

31:19.280 --> 31:21.880
Believe in your beauty

31:22.800 --> 31:24.520
and good luck.

31:29.080 --> 31:31.560
BEAUTY

31:32.640 --> 31:35.520
You should've known
that you don't belong, Ying.

31:36.240 --> 31:39.760
But sadly, you really want to win.

31:41.680 --> 31:45.320
Do you think you're the only one
who can be the Shining Star?

31:47.200 --> 31:49.920
Beauty does not last forever.

31:50.680 --> 31:53.000
Okay? And because I know that truth,

31:53.640 --> 31:54.960
you will get in my way.

31:55.560 --> 31:58.040
I know that I can win this thing.

31:58.120 --> 32:00.520
In tenth place like you?
[chuckles]

32:04.960 --> 32:06.440
Look at this. I'll show you.

32:06.520 --> 32:07.800
-[grunts]
-[shrieks]

32:07.880 --> 32:10.120
[upbeat music playing]

32:43.880 --> 32:47.640
[Ying screaming]

32:55.360 --> 32:57.200
[Gade laughing]

33:19.040 --> 33:21.880
[computer-generated voice]
Hello. Our ranking system

33:21.960 --> 33:24.200
is now back online.

33:25.480 --> 33:27.360
[director] Hello, everyone.

33:27.440 --> 33:30.160
We'd like you all
to gather in the main hall

33:30.240 --> 33:33.680
to reveal our top ten

33:33.760 --> 33:36.440
and the winner of the Shining Star award.

33:36.520 --> 33:39.880
It is our hope that you believe
in the power of your beauty.

33:40.520 --> 33:44.200
Beauty is the most important asset
a woman can have.

33:45.840 --> 33:48.920
Welcome, all. Let's begin the awards now.

33:49.800 --> 33:55.040
Every year, the competition
to name our Shining Star

33:55.120 --> 33:57.880
gets more and more challenging.

33:58.480 --> 34:00.360
[crowd clapping]

34:01.520 --> 34:04.520
In an effort not to waste any more time,

34:05.760 --> 34:08.000
let's take a look at your Shining Star.

34:08.080 --> 34:10.520
This year's award goes to…

34:11.639 --> 34:14.440
[classical music playing]

34:42.760 --> 34:43.880
You can't do that.

34:45.080 --> 34:46.600
[Ying] Who even is she?

34:46.679 --> 34:48.360
She doesn't go to our school.

34:49.280 --> 34:53.480
No matter what,
the Shining Star belongs to me.

34:54.800 --> 34:58.920
Young lady, we must have faith
in our friend's beauty as well.

35:00.160 --> 35:05.000
And with that being said,
this year's award goes to…

35:09.920 --> 35:11.520
[crowd gasps]

35:12.640 --> 35:14.280
[indistinct chatter]

35:26.640 --> 35:30.000
[stammering]
Thank you…

35:30.080 --> 35:32.440
to the school for…

35:32.520 --> 35:36.200
-Didn't she use to be fat?
-[Chompoo] …for giving me…

35:37.440 --> 35:39.160
…the opportunity.

35:39.920 --> 35:44.880
[stammering]
Thank you…

35:44.960 --> 35:48.800
for letting me into…

35:50.640 --> 35:52.760
for making my…

35:53.800 --> 36:00.200
Chompoo… I am very grateful to you all.

36:00.280 --> 36:01.280
Thanks.

36:03.080 --> 36:07.480
[crowd applauding]

36:08.160 --> 36:09.960
[director] Don't forget

36:10.040 --> 36:11.640
that beauty is your value.

36:11.720 --> 36:14.800
Let's thank our beauty for what it does.

36:16.840 --> 36:18.800
To all of you out there,

36:18.880 --> 36:21.160
you're all beautiful

36:21.760 --> 36:23.800
and don't you ever forget.

36:24.520 --> 36:26.640
I believe in you. Good luck.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.840
Now, go and shine.

36:30.560 --> 36:32.200
BEAUTY

36:37.440 --> 36:40.240
[theme music]

37:42.720 --> 37:47.040
Subtitle translation by
Pet-chompoo Sa-ngarmangkang
